[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4074179649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109985#issuecomment-4074179649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109985","id":4074179649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7y1wxB","user":{"login":"Innokentiy-Alaytsev","id":877227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev","html_url":"https://github.com/Innokentiy-Alaytsev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Innokentiy-Alaytsev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-17T11:11:32Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T11:11:32Z","body":"Hi there, hello! Someone interested in partial 3D texture updates here. \r\n\r\nIt might not be the best place for questions, but still. I have a question about the implementation of the feature and its future:\r\n\r\nAs far as I can see, partial update is performed using data from a `PackedByteArray`, which is required to be the exact size of the patched texture region. Would it be possible to have a version that works on a region of the source data as well? The use case is simple. Let there be some voxel data that is edited on CPU and rendered using a 3D texture. Copying the edited regions into separate `PackedByeArray` after every editing becomes expensive very fast due to memory allocation and fragmentation, and data copying. If I understand correctly, the data is copied again into some rendering device buffers. Allowing to pass the full dataset and only copying data from the given region eliminates the unnecessary memory allocations and data copying. Exposing this version to GDExtension with `Span<uint8_t>` would be especially interesting, because it would allow using external data storage, which might not be `PackedByteArray`.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4074179649/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4814629021","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109985#issuecomment-4814629021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109985","id":4814629021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHvlonQ","user":{"login":"ozzr","id":36895302,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODk1MzAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36895302?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr","html_url":"https://github.com/ozzr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ozzr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T01:51:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T01:51:44Z","body":"hi, what is the state of this pr?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4814629021/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4815307984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109985#issuecomment-4815307984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109985","id":4815307984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHwPE0A","user":{"login":"Armynator","id":5256247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTYyNDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5256247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator","html_url":"https://github.com/Armynator","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T04:56:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T04:56:24Z","body":"It works, but it looks like it's not maintained actively. I've been using it for about 5 months now in production on WebGL without any issues.\r\n\r\nTo make it compile for Godot 4.7, in `servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp` change\r\n```\r\ncopy_region.texture_subresources.aspect = texture->read_aspect_flags;\r\ncopy_region.texture_subresources.mipmap = p_dst_mipmap;\r\ncopy_region.texture_subresources.base_layer = p_dst_layer;\r\ncopy_region.texture_subresources.layer_count = 1;\r\n```\r\nto\r\n```\r\ncopy_region.texture_subresource.aspect = texture->read_aspect_flags.has_flag(RDD::TEXTURE_ASPECT_DEPTH_BIT) ? RDD::TEXTURE_ASPECT_DEPTH : RDD::TEXTURE_ASPECT_COLOR;\r\ncopy_region.texture_subresource.mipmap = p_dst_mipmap;\r\ncopy_region.texture_subresource.layer = p_dst_layer;\r\n```\r\n\r\nTo make it compile with 4.8/current master after #115003 was added, in `servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp` remove\r\n```uint32_t pixel_rshift = get_compressed_image_format_pixel_rshift(texture->format);```\r\nand replace \r\n```uint32_t region_pitch = (region_w * pixel_size * block_w) >> pixel_rshift;```\r\nwith\r\n```uint32_t region_pitch = get_compressed_image_format_pixels_shifted(texture->format, region_w * pixel_size * block_w);```\r\nThat way it uses the new `get_compressed_image_format_pixels_shifted` to do the shifting.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4815307984/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5098740409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109985#issuecomment-5098740409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109985","id":5098740409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL-iauQ","user":{"login":"Shardj","id":5624120,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjQxMjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5624120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj","html_url":"https://github.com/Shardj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T01:16:22Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T15:45:36Z","body":"What's holding this PR back from being merged? It's a huge blocker for me currently in my brick atlas implementation. Re-uploading the full texture just to add a single new brick isn't realistic. I'll have to try Armynator's suggestion, but having this maintained and part of the codebase would be great\r\n\r\nEdit: This PR works great in vulkan by the way","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5098740409/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5477438211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109985#issuecomment-5477438211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109985","id":5477438211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRnsTAw","user":{"login":"tutabot","id":178655317,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqYQVQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178655317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot","html_url":"https://github.com/tutabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tutabot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-31T11:07:01Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T11:07:01Z","body":"I have a Godot 2D image editor project, where I need to be able to efficiently and partially update high resolution textures. Right now I have to read the whole texture pixel by pixel to make this work. Needless to say this is anything but performant and I have stopped developing this project for this reason. I hope this gets merged.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5477438211/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5524862597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109985#issuecomment-5524862597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109985","id":5524862597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSU62hQ","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T11:15:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T11:15:21Z","body":"> I have a Godot 2D image editor project, where I need to be able to efficiently and partially update high resolution textures. \r\n\r\nI haven't tested it, but I'm working on a similar sprite editor in parallel, and this function is absolutely necessary.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5524862597/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]